---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
  title="Panduan & Tutorial STORIQ - Integrasi SumoPod"
  description="Panduan langkah demi langkah menggunakan STORIQ dan cara mendapatkan API key dari SumoPod."
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <!-- ==================== 1. HERO SECTION ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-navy-800 text-white py-14 sm:py-20 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-navy-700">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-400/30 text-blue-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        <span>📚</span>
        <span>Tutorial & Panduan Praktis</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight text-white">
        Panduan Lengkap <span class="text-blue-400">STORIQ</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
        Pelajari cara menggunakan STORIQ dari nol sampai bisa melakukan 
        <strong class="font-semibold text-white">content repurposing otomatis</strong> menggunakan integrasi API SumoPod.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 2. CARA PAKAI STORIQ ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-24 relative" id="cara-pakai">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Workflow Dasar</h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Cara Pakai STORIQ</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Proses merubah satu ide abstrak menjadi puluhan format konten matang siap unggah.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline Steps -->
      <div class="relative space-y-8 before:absolute before:inset-0 before:ml-5 before:-translate-x-px md:before:mx-auto md:before:translate-x-0 before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-slate-200 before:to-transparent">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10">
            1
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Buka Generator & Isi Konteks</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Masuk ke halaman <strong>Generator</strong>. Isi <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Topik Utama</span> (ide dasar kamu), 
              <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Target Audiens</span>, dan 
              <span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Tujuan Konten</span>. Semakin spesifik, semakin bagus hasilnya.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10">
            2
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Pilih Tone & Framework</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Tentukan nada bicara (Tone) yang sesuai dengan brand kamu. Kemudian pilih <strong>Framework Storytelling</strong>.
              Kami sangat menyarankan memilih <em>STORIQ 10 Elemen</em> untuk hasil konten persuasif yang menyeluruh.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10">
            3
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <div class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-200 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold rounded mb-2">PILIH MODE</div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Pilih Mode Eksekusi</h4>
            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc ml-4">
              <li>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">Prompt Generator (Manual):</strong> STORIQ akan merakit prompt rahasia super detail. Copy dan paste ke ChatGPT/Claude kamu sendiri.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong class="text-slate-800">SumoPod BYOK (Otomatis):</strong> STORIQ akan langsung berkomunikasi dengan AI dan men-generate hasilnya di layar yang sama. (Membutuhkan integrasi API).
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 z-10">
            4
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-3rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Dapatkan Hasil & Repurpose</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Setelah mendapatkan konten utama (Artikel), gunakan tombol-tombol <strong>Repurpose</strong> di bagian bawah hasil untuk menyulapnya menjadi bentuk lain dalam 1x klik: 
              <em>Carousel IG, Thread X, Video Script, LinkedIn Post, dll.</em>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 3. TUTORIAL SUMOPOD ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 py-16 sm:py-24 border-y border-slate-200" id="api-gratis">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full mb-4">
          PANDUAN INTEGRASI (MODE OTOMATIS)
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">
          Cara Mendapatkan API Key <span class="text-blue-600">SumoPod</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Untuk menggunakan fitur <strong>Generate Otomatis</strong>, STORIQ terintegrasi penuh dengan ekosistem SumoPod. Ikuti langkah singkat di bawah ini.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Keamanan Badge -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 mb-12 shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-50 text-amber-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-2xl border border-amber-100">
          🔒
        </div>
        <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">Apakah API Key Kamu Aman di STORIQ?</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Ya, 100% aman!</strong> STORIQ adalah aplikasi <em>static client-side</em> tanpa server database. 
            Kunci API kamu divalidasi dan <strong>hanya disimpan di memori browser lokalmu</strong> (<code>localStorage</code>). 
            Tidak ada pihak ketiga yang bisa melihat atau mencurinya.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Langkah SumoPod -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white border-2 border-blue-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/5 relative">
          
          <!-- Card Header -->
          <div class="bg-blue-50/50 p-6 sm:p-8 border-b border-blue-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-200 text-2xl shrink-0">
                ⚡
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                  SumoPod API
                </h3>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Platform Agregator AI Frontiers</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a href="https://ai.sumopod.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-sm">
              Buka ai.sumopod.com
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card Content -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm tracking-wider uppercase mb-5 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-blue-500">📋</span> LANGKAH-LANGKAH:
            </h4>
            
            <ul class="space-y-4">
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">1</span>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Buka website resmi AI SumoPod di <a href="https://ai.sumopod.com/" target="_blank" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">ai.sumopod.com</a>.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">2</span>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Lakukan <strong>Login</strong> atau pendaftaran menggunakan akun Google / GitHub kamu.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">3</span>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Pilih menu <strong>API Keys</strong> di panel dashboard.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">4</span>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Klik tombol <strong>Create new API Key</strong>. Beri nama key tersebut (misal: "Untuk STORIQ").
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">5</span>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Klik tombol <strong>Copy</strong> pada kode string (<code>sk-sumo...</code>) yang muncul.
                </p>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">6</span>
                <div class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Buka menu <a href={`${baseUrl}pengaturan/`} class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">Pengaturan STORIQ</a>.
                  Tempelkan (<em>paste</em>) API key tersebut, lalu klik <strong>Simpan & Hubungkan</strong>. Selesai!
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 4. FAQ / BANTUAN ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Pertanyaan Seputar API</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- FAQ 1 -->
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Apakah saya wajib punya API Key?</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            <strong>Tidak wajib.</strong> STORIQ memiliki fitur "Prompt Generator". Kamu cukup klik generate prompt, lalu copy hasilnya dan paste secara manual ke ChatGPT atau Claude yang biasa kamu gunakan. Hasil akhirnya sama sempurnanya!
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ 2 -->
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Error "API Key tidak valid" saat dihubungkan?</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Pastikan kamu menyalin (copy) <em>seluruh</em> karakter key tanpa ada spasi yang terpotong. 
            Jika masih gagal, coba buat API Key baru (Create new API Key) di dashboard SumoPod dan gunakan key yang baru tersebut.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- FAQ 3 -->
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-slate-50 hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg mb-2">Di mana data API Key saya disimpan?</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            API key yang kamu masukkan hanya tersimpan di <code>localStorage</code> pada browser di HP atau laptopmu sendiri. Saat kamu menutup browser dan membukanya lagi, key tersebut masih ada. Namun jika kamu ganti perangkat, kamu harus memasukkannya lagi.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy-900 to-navy-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Siap Membuat Konten?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mb-8 text-lg">Pilih jalur manual atau otomatis, semuanya didesain gratis untukmu.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href={`${baseUrl}generator/`} class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30">
          Buka Generator →
        </a>
        <a href={`${baseUrl}pengaturan/`} class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/20 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
          Hubungkan API Key
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Base>
